{"t":"A Runaway Goblin","s":"a-runaway-goblin-c72b4","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">A Runaway Goblin</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tKrailos Steppe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos\">Krailos</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subarea\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Subarea</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos%20Steppe\">Krailos Steppe</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145909&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33523,31669,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33523, 31669, 8)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Goblin</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Merchant</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.90<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2015<br/>Winter Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230725041523&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/A_Runaway_Goblin_f8d1c6.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see A Runaway Goblin.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Down a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pitfall\">Pitfall</a> in the west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos\">Krailos</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>He refuses to tell you his name, as he is wanted by the Ogres.Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for A Runaway Goblin.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Hu-man! Strange guest! What want? Say!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Oh, kind hu-man asks for goblin name! But too dangerous, am sought goblin! Ogres must not know!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Time for hu-man to go away? Yes indeed!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Am, er, purveyor of things! Yes! Bring stuff where needed, discreetly-like! Heheh!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>runaway</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Yes! Not stay at ogre camp! Not wait to become tasty goblin soup, oh no! Not want to wipe hairy ogre backside, no no no!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>ogres</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Urgh, ogre smell baaad! Like rotten rat cheese and dragon eggs! Terrible day for goblins when ogres found us! Slavery, sadness, sorrow!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Vuzrog</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Big gobbler of sweet. Here free tip for you, hu-man. Throw cookie into air to keep him busy while flee! Heheh.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Ghorza</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Shaman ogre? She no bother. Dancing around cactus tree, not see small goblin, heheh.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Larek</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Huh, hu-man who not know how to run. Too busy scribbling down things. Now has to make ogre cookies or become one himself!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Nibble</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Ahhh! You spoke to Golozo Taku Narkat Kash Bartak Har-Alhad! Him still alive, that good news!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Golozo Taku Narkat Kash Bartak Har-Alhad</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Please stop trying to say name correctly, hu-man. You no goblin.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Garamor Avolok Tor-Mazak</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Nice try, hu-man. But hu-man hear not all there is to hear. Need goblin ears!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Swordfish</b>/<b>Hopgoblin</b>/<b>Sugatrap</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: No time for stories about great goblin, hu-man! You go about business, I do too.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>goblins</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Very perspicacious hu-man!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>quest</b>/<b>mission</b>/<b>weapon</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: &lt;puts finger to his lips&gt;<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>crossbow</b>/<b>lance</b>/<b>staff</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Me not know anything!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nA Runaway Goblin: Yes, please go!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">A Runaway Goblin</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["krailos-quest"],"pos":{"x":33523,"y":31669,"z":8}}